cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on this harness, please cite it as below."
title: "Be-Ambitious Harness: a planner / worker / verifier workflow for ambitious AI tasks"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Alexandr
    family-names: Chernov
    alias: alexpr
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/alexpiar/be-ambitious-harness"
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code skill and plain-markdown harness that turns a task into a prompt
  with two bars (baseline and ambitious), a cheap gate check with a pass criterion
  fixed before it runs, and an independent verifier that never sees the worker's
  reasoning. Ships with six scenario playbooks and an eval suite.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - claude-skill
  - prompt-engineering
  - ai-agents
  - multi-agent
  - llm-as-a-judge
  - evaluation
